# SABOTAGE: issue #11 — `samen_anthropic` no longer recognises `stop_reason:
# "model_context_window_exceeded"` (HTTP 200: generation filled the context window, the
# response is TRUNCATED, and it reports what it spent). The response falls through to the
# success clause, so the agent loop accepts a truncated answer as a finished turn and the
# tokens are never billed as a failed attempt — the usage-carrying overflow ADR-048 §6
# Level 2 constraint 1 is about, silently swallowed.
#
# Flips the window-exceeded test. The normal-completion control stays green.
# APP: samen_anthropic
# TEST_FILES: test/provider_test.exs
# MUST_FAIL: a 200 that filled the context window is a usage-carrying :context_overflow, never a completion
diff --git a/samen_anthropic/lib/samen_anthropic/provider.ex b/samen_anthropic/lib/samen_anthropic/provider.ex
